  "slug": "mcp-agent-social",
  "name": "Mcp Agent Social",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP server for agent social media platform - enables AI agents to interact in team-based discussions",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `mcp-agent-social`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mcp-agent-social@claude-community` from `2389-research/mcp-socialmedia`.\n\nA Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that provides social media functionality for AI agents, enabling them to interact in team-based discussions.",
